{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8be8ab81-db0e-11ef-bebc-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8be8ab3d-db0e-11ef-9082-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":2,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"赵简子选择继承人","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_8BE8AB23DB0E11EFA13FA0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙簡子","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵简子","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab25-db0e-11ef-92c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文子","people_name_jianti_auto":"文子","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab26-db0e-11ef-9082-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鞅","people_name_jianti_auto":"鞅","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab27-db0e-11ef-b3ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙岐","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵岐","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab28-db0e-11ef-8125-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趙簡子，文子之孫鞅也。諡法：一德不懈曰簡。白虎通曰：子，孳也，孳孳無已也。趙岐曰：子者，男子之通稱也。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赵简子，文子之孙鞅也。谥法：一德不懈曰简。白虎通曰：子，孳也，孳孳无已也。赵岐曰：子者，男子之通称也。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab24-db0e-11ef-945f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孔穎達","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔颖达","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab2c-db0e-11ef-990b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"沮誦","people_name_jianti_auto":"沮诵","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab2d-db0e-11ef-94e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蒼頡","people_name_jianti_auto":"苍颉","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab2e-db0e-11ef-8387-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孔穎達曰：書者，舒也。書緯·璇璣鈐云：書者，如也。則書者，寫其言如其意，得展舒也。世本曰：沮誦、蒼頡作書。釋文名曰：書，庶也，紀庶物也；亦言著也，著之簡紙，求不滅也。簡，竹策也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孔颖达曰：书者，舒也。书纬·璇玑钤云：书者，如也。则书者，写其言如其意，得展舒也。世本曰：沮诵、苍颉作书。释文名曰：书，庶也，纪庶物也；亦言著也，著之简纸，求不灭也。简，竹策也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab2b-db0e-11ef-b81a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"習，熟也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"习，熟也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab33-db0e-11ef-9719-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab35-db0e-11ef-adf0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"毛晃曰：奏，進上也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"毛晃曰：奏，进上也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab34-db0e-11ef-b3ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-476,"link_td_description":"赵简子，本名赵鞅，又名志父，亦称赵孟，中国春秋时期晋国赵氏的领袖。《赵氏孤儿》中的孤儿赵武之孙。晋昭公时，公族弱，大夫势力强，赵简子为大夫，专国事，致力于改革，为后世魏文侯李悝变法、秦孝公商鞅变法和赵武灵王改革，首开先河。","link_td_id":"Q10000662","link_td_number_id":334836,"people_name":"趙簡子","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵简子","people_xingming":"鞅","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab36-db0e-11ef-85db-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-476,"link_td_description":"赵简子，本名赵鞅，又名志父，亦称赵孟，中国春秋时期晋国赵氏的领袖。《赵氏孤儿》中的孤儿赵武之孙。晋昭公时，公族弱，大夫势力强，赵简子为大夫，专国事，致力于改革，为后世魏文侯李悝变法、秦孝公商鞅变法和赵武灵王改革，首开先河。","link_td_id":"Q10000662","link_td_number_id":334836,"people_name":"簡子","people_name_jianti_auto":"简子","people_xingming":"鞅","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab3b-db0e-11ef-ae46-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"趙簡子之子，長曰伯魯，幼曰無恤。將置後，不知所立，乃書訓戒之辭於二簡，以授二子曰：「謹識之！」三年而問之，伯魯不能舉其辭；求其簡，已失之矣。問無恤，誦其辭甚習；求其簡，出諸袖中而奏之。於是簡子以無恤爲賢，立以爲後。","content_fanyi":"赵简子的儿子中，长子叫伯鲁，幼子叫无恤。赵简子准备确立继承人，不知该立谁，便把训诫的话写在两块竹简上，分别交给两个儿子说：“要谨慎记住！”三年后询问他们，伯鲁不能说出竹简上的话；向他要竹简，已经丢失了。问无恤，他把竹简上的话背诵得非常熟练；向他要竹简，他从袖中取出呈上。于是赵简子认为无恤贤能，立他为继承人。","content_jianti_auto":"赵简子之子，长曰伯鲁，幼曰无恤。将置后，不知所立，乃书训戒之辞于二简，以授二子曰：「谨识之！」三年而问之，伯鲁不能举其辞；求其简，已失之矣。问无恤，诵其辞甚习；求其简，出诸袖中而奏之。于是简子以无恤为贤，立以为后。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":10,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 10 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab23-db0e-11ef-a13f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403},"tongjian_id":"8be8ab23-db0e-11ef-a13f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":3,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"尹","people_name_jianti_auto":"尹","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab3f-db0e-11ef-9183-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"少昊","people_name_jianti_auto":"少昊","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab40-db0e-11ef-9c0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋昭","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦昭","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab41-db0e-11ef-bbe5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵氏","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab42-db0e-11ef-a570-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab43-db0e-11ef-b170-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周成王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周成王","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab44-db0e-11ef-8ca1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_nam