9,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab65-db0e-11ef-91d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"榆次縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"榆次县","start_index":174,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab66-db0e-11ef-ab03-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋阳县","start_index":182,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab67-db0e-11ef-9660-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"榆次縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"榆次县","start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab68-db0e-11ef-b23f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鑿臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"凿台","start_index":194,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab69-db0e-11ef-b8b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鑿臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"凿台","start_index":207,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab6a-db0e-11ef-8155-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋阳","start_index":223,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab6b-db0e-11ef-b558-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":230,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab6c-db0e-11ef-9a7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":243,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab6d-db0e-11ef-937a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉水","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋水","start_index":247,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab6e-db0e-11ef-b02b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":254,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab6f-db0e-11ef-a83a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":263,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab70-db0e-11ef-9165-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":268,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab71-db0e-11ef-9884-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜：尹，少昊之子，封於尹城，子孫因爲氏。韋昭曰：晉陽，趙氏邑。爲，治也。班志曰：晉陽，故詩唐國。周成王滅唐，封弟叔虞。龍山在西，晉水所出，東入汾。臣瓚曰：所謂唐，今河東永安縣是也，去晉四百里。括地志曰：晉陽故城，今名晉城，在蒲州虞鄕縣西。今按水經註：晉水出晉陽縣西龍山。昔智伯遏晉水以灌晉陽，其水分爲二流，北瀆卽智氏故渠也。同過水出沾縣北山，西過榆次縣南，又西到晉陽縣南。榆次縣南水側有鑿臺，戰國策所謂「智伯死於鑿臺之下」，卽此處也。參而考之，晉陽故城恐不在蒲州。水經註又云：叔虞封於唐，縣有晉水，故改名爲晉。子夏序詩，「此晉也而謂之唐」，是也，與班志合。瓚說及括地志未知何據。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱：尹，少昊之子，封于尹城，子孙因为氏。韦昭曰：晋阳，赵氏邑。为，治也。班志曰：晋阳，故诗唐国。周成王灭唐，封弟叔虞。龙山在西，晋水所出，东入汾。臣瓒曰：所谓唐，今河东永安县是也，去晋四百里。括地志曰：晋阳故城，今名晋城，在蒲州虞鄕县西。今按水经注：晋水出晋阳县西龙山。昔智伯遏晋水以灌晋阳，其水分为二流，北渎即智氏故渠也。同过水出沾县北山，西过榆次县南，又西到晋阳县南。榆次县南水侧有凿台，战国策所谓「智伯死于凿台之下」，即此处也。参而考之，晋阳故城恐不在蒲州。水经注又云：叔虞封于唐，县有晋水，故改名为晋。子夏序诗，「此晋也而谓之唐」，是也，与班志合。瓒说及括地志未知何据。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab3e-db0e-11ef-a4c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋祁","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋祁","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab7d-db0e-11ef-9ea0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"繭絲，謂浚民之膏澤，如抽繭之緒，不盡則不止。保障，謂厚民之生，如築堡以自障，愈培則愈厚。宋祁曰：障，之亮翻，又音章。","note_content_jianti_auto":"茧丝，谓浚民之膏泽，如抽茧之绪，不尽则不止。保障，谓厚民之生，如筑堡以自障，愈培则愈厚。宋祁曰：障，之亮翻，又音章。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab7c-db0e-11ef-84d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋昭","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦昭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab7f-db0e-11ef-92d3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"韋昭曰：損其戶，則民優而稅少。","note_content_jianti_auto":"韦昭曰：损其户，则民优而税少。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab7e-db0e-11ef-a1c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"而，汝也。難，乃旦翻，患也，阨也。少，音多少之少。重之爲多，輕之爲少。","note_content_jianti_auto":"而，汝也。难，乃旦翻，患也，阨也。少，音多少之少。重之为多，轻之为少。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab80-db0e-11ef-9ae0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-476,"link_td_description":"赵简子，本名赵鞅，又名志父，亦称赵孟，中国春秋时期晋国赵氏的领袖。《赵氏孤儿》中的孤儿赵武之孙。晋昭公时，公族弱，大夫势力强，赵简子为大夫，专国事，致力于改革，为后世魏文侯李悝变法、秦孝公商鞅变法和赵武灵王改革，首开先河。","link_td_id":"Q10000662","link_td_number_id":334836,"people_name":"簡子","people_name_jianti_auto":"简子","people_xingming":"赵鞅","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab81-db0e-11ef-bebc-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[趙鞅]"},{"link_death_year":-476,"link_td_description":"赵简子，本名赵鞅，又名志父，亦称赵孟，中国春秋时期晋国赵氏的领袖。《赵氏孤儿》中的孤儿赵武之孙。晋昭公时，公族弱，大夫势力强，赵简子为大夫，专国事，致力于改革，为后世魏文侯李悝变法、秦孝公商鞅变法和赵武灵王改革，首开先河。","link_td_id":"Q10000662","link_td_number_id":334836,"people_name":"簡子","people_name_jianti_auto":"简子","people_xingming":"赵鞅","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab84-db0e-11ef-b574-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[趙鞅]"},{"link_death_year":-476,"link_td_description":"赵简子，本名赵鞅，又名志父，亦称赵孟，中国春秋时期晋国赵氏的领袖。《赵氏孤儿》中的孤儿赵武之孙。晋昭公时，公族弱，大夫势力强，赵简子为大夫，专国事，致力于改革，为后世魏文侯李悝变法、秦孝公商鞅变法和赵武灵王改革，首开先河。","link_td_id":"Q10000662","link_td_number_id":334836,"people_name":"簡子","people_name_jianti_auto":"简子","people_xingming":"赵鞅","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab86-db0e-11ef-ac5f-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[趙鞅]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"簡子使尹鐸爲晉陽，請曰：「以爲繭絲乎？抑爲保障乎？」簡子曰：「保障哉！」尹鐸損其戶數。簡子謂無恤曰：「晉國有難，而無以尹鐸爲少，無以晉陽爲遠，必以爲歸。」","content_fanyi":"赵简子派尹铎去治理晋阳。尹铎请示说：“您是想让我把那里当作抽茧取丝般搜刮民财的地方，还是当作保障之地？”赵简子说：“作保障！”尹铎于是核减了当地民户的数目。赵简子对无恤说：“晋国一旦有难，不要嫌尹铎身份低微，不要嫌晋阳路途遥远，一定要把那里作为归宿。”","content_jianti_auto":"简子使尹铎为晋阳，请曰：「以为茧丝乎？抑为保障乎？」简子曰：「保障哉！」尹铎损其户数。简子谓无恤曰：「晋国有难，而无以尹铎为少，无以晋阳为远，必以为归。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 11 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab3d-db0e-11ef-9082-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403,"zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000336"},"tongjian_id":"8be8ab3d-db0e-11ef-9082-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"枚乘","people_name_jianti_auto":"枚乘","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"98173626-db0e-11ef-b3d4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吳王","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴王","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"98173627-db0e-11ef-8fd6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"去，羌呂翻。前書：枚乘諫吳王曰：欲湯之凔，一人炊之，百人揚之，無益也，不如絕薪止火而已。凔，音則亮翻，寒也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"去，羌吕翻。前书：枚乘谏吴王曰：欲汤之凔，一人炊之，百人扬之，无益也，不如绝薪止火而已。凔，音则亮翻，寒也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"98173625-db0e-11ef-b3e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言癰疽蘊結，破之雖痛，勝於內食肌肉，浸淫滋大也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言痈疽蕴结，破之虽痛，胜于内食肌肉，浸淫滋大也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"98173629-db0e-11ef-873b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙鞅","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵鞅","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9817362b-db0e-11ef-beea-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荀寅","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀寅","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9817362c-db0e-11ef-b41f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"士吉射","people_name_jianti_auto":"士吉射","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"9817362d-db0e-11ef-b8d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9817362e-db0e-11ef-b571-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋阳","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9817362f-db0e-11ef-a2e4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"公羊傳曰：晉趙鞅取晉陽之甲以逐荀寅與士吉射者曷爲？君側之惡人也。此逐君側之惡人，曷爲以叛言之？無君命也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"公羊传曰：晋赵鞅取晋阳之甲以逐荀寅与士吉射者曷为？君侧之恶人也。此逐君侧之恶人，曷为以叛言之？无君命也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"9817362a-db0e-11ef-a7d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"98173632-db0e-11ef-9e08-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：鳴鐘鼓者，聲其罪也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：鸣钟鼓者，声其罪也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"98173631-db0e-11ef-b2c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"何后","people_name_jianti_auto":"何后","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"98173634-db0e-11ef-9d17-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"進","people_name_jianti_auto":"进","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"98173635-db0e-11ef-9a03-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言何后因宦官得進，進兄弟以此致富貴也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言何后因宦官得进，进兄弟以此致富贵也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"98173633-db0e-11ef-be88-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"水覆於地，不可復收，言事發則不可收拾。","note_content_jianti_auto":"水覆于地，不可复收，言事发则不可收拾。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"98173637-db0e-11ef-9a61-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"E